flowchart LR
  Producers[Product and service events] --> Stream[Streaming backbone]
  Stream --> Realtime[Real-time processors]
  Stream --> Lake[Durable lake or warehouse]
  Realtime --> Serving[Low-latency serving stores]
  Lake --> Batch[Batch analytics and model training]
  Batch --> Models[Models and decision systems]
  Serving --> Product[Product experience]
  Models --> Product
  Product --> Producers
